OL,3,GNEWSA'I passed my advanced driving test
OL,4,Aaged 72'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who recently passed his advanced
OL,7,Fdriving test at the age of 72 said it
OL,8,Fhad made him a "better driver".
OL,10,FPaul Kalinauckas, from Wellington,
OL,11,FShropshire, decided to take a few
OL,12,Flessons to make sure he was still up to
OL,13,Fscratch behind the wheel after he
OL,14,Fturned 70 and had to renew his expired
OL,15,Fdriving licence.
OL,17,FUnder current rules from the
OL,18,Fgovernment, drivers aged over 70 in the
OL,19,FUK must renew their driving licence and
OL,20,Fupdate their photograph every three
OL,21,Fyears.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
