OL,3,GNEWSA'I passed my advanced driving test
OL,4,Aaged 72'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking to BBC Radio Shropshire, he
OL,7,Fsaid: "It's over 50 years since I did
OL,8,Fmy driving test, a long time ago... I
OL,9,Fthought, 'I'm going to prove I'm a good
OL,10,Fdriver', [which is] one of the reasons
OL,11,Fthat I did it."
